      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "One or more worlds (C--- ---e) have also been exceptionally added to cross-platform spotlight category recently by being friends with one or more VRChat Team members (F--------).\n\nThe \"certain world has been featured on the VRChat menu banner\" (FISH ǃ ［RELEASE］ by Godfall) is also a promotional source of revenue for VRChat, due to the world's popularity (> 1M visits in the first week of release) and Creator Economy transactions available in that world.\n\n> I've also heard that colliders have been disabled as a special measure for that world.\n\nThat is not the case as far as I know, mobile users (Meta Quest HMDs) in particular require a face mirror enabled for avatar flight assets.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
