      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Okay, interesting, `admin_disable_avatar_collision` and `admin_disable_avatar_stations` tags have been added (admin-gated) to FISH ǃ ［RELEASE］ today, but these options are not available to world creators to customize the experience in user-created worlds.",
