      },
      "restoredAt": null,
      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Additionally, I've seen many comments on social media saying, \"It's wrong to complain about a system that makes money.\"\n\nWhat I find problematic is that due to a lack of regular communication, despite requests for this convenient feature having been made before ( https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/collider-on-avatar-should-be-disabled-by-safety ), exceptions were made for specific worlds, and the speed with which it was addressed was unprecedented. There were other tasks that needed to be addressed, such as the invalid OGP tag being left unaddressed for over three years ( https://feedback.vrchat.com/website/p/ogp-is-not-correct ), and the suggestion to explicitly state AI-generated content being left unaddressed despite receiving 200 votes ( https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/require-content-using-generative-ai-to-declare-it ).\n\nI'd like to hear a statement from the admins soon. VRChat should be an ecosystem that raises money, but it is also a world created by creators.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
